# How to run the project
1. Just write the command in the terminal inside this directory:
    make
This will create a binary named "knapsack".
2. Write the command, like in the last step:
    ./knapsack
This will generate a file named "main.tex" inside the folder "texs" and at the same time it runs "pdflatex" to generate the pdf in the folder "others", named "main.pdf"

